factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The reel_script states that the Vijaya Balaji controversy involved a call to the police superintendent at night at his home; the article only says that a question about this was answered as 'முகாந்திரம் இல்லாதது' - the reel_script's phrasing 'அழைத்து பேசிய செய்தி' is acceptable, but the draft's slide and reel 'விஜய பாலாஜி' is named without the article giving his role, while the article does name him as minister (அமைச்சர்) - the title/role is consistent.
  The caption and reel_script say the helmet distribution was done by the minister 'வாகன ஓட்டிகளுக்கு ஹெல்மெட்களை அமைச்சர் சம்பத்குமார் வழங்கினார்' - this is supported by the article.
  The caption states that the Vijaya Balaji matter is 'தொடர்பான விமர்சனம்' and that the minister 'விளக்கமளித்தார்' - the article says it was about Tamilaga Vettri Kazhagam administrators and the minister said the criticism lacked basis; the caption omits that the criticism concerns Tamilaga Vettri Kazhagam administrators, which is a missing key fact.
  The reel_script states 'மிதிவண்டிகளுடன் ஹெல்மெட் வழங்கப்பட உள்ளது' as a fact in the headline ('மாணவர் மிதிவண்டிக்கு ஹெல்மெட் வழங்க திட்டம்') - the article says helmets will be given with bicycles provided to students, which matches; no error there.
  The caption says 'ஹெல்மெட் அணியாததைப் பேஷனாக நினைக்கக்கூடாது என மக்கள் கேட்டுக்கொள்ளப்பட்டனர்' - the article shows the minister said this, not that people were asked; it misattributes the statement's passive framing and changes who made the request.
