factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  The article says the ministers' remarks were about helmets for school students' bicycles to be given by the government, but the draft's reel_script and slides say the helmet distribution was also for students in a way consistent with the article; however, the draft states Vijaya Balaji's 'night-time calling of the police superintendent' is a controversy, while the article only says the claim is unfounded and does not identify the controversy as an accusation by a named party—minor, but the caption also adds 'இரவில் வீட்டில்' which matches the article.
  The reel_script says 'தமிழக வெற்றி கழக நிர்வாகிகள் மீதான விமர்சனங்கள்' and the article wording is 'விமர்சனங்கள் எழுவது' — acceptable. The slide 'அமைச்சர் சம்பத்குமார் சிறப்பு' cuts off the article's 'சிறப்பு விருந்தினர்' phrasing, creating an ungrammatical fragment.
  The reel_script says 'அமைச்சரின் கருத்து' and 'விஜய பாலாஜி சர்ச்சை முகாந்திரம் இல்லாத தகவல் என்றார்' in slide 4 presents the minister's statement as if about Vijaya Balaji's conduct, mixing two different facts into one line (the controversy topic and the unfounded-information remark).
  The reel_script and caption omit the article's point that Vijaya Balaji is named as a minister and the controversy concerns Tamilaga Vettri Kazhagam officials, so the link between the two sentences is unclear.
